name": "4.png", "id": "1470238121060573", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825497_1470238124393906_840229317181390784_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VL4XElDM6SEQ7kNvwHbh55O&_nc_oc=AdqYNOOkrK6msitElknXg_o9uSVrCzffrY4gR-KLwWscjQnfa8Cl_1_gZj4yUvmN2Wk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT8zBNr_6pLv4VkoiZTnWKpHvzYGwUInNjulOeekK7X5Q&oe=6AF480B2"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "4299448770304785", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823341_4299448773638118_6198794168639950814_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z9K3ffqT5w4Q7kNvwEv1sbS&_nc_oc=AdoB0kk2kLBss3w356eOtr9xNjpH5HGPcxEiC9HKfpnJ6OssC1ZPjBJG5O6f7CFJGn8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSXpv7vQ72eKkSBt0poEE4lQk7IupinI09vLjOTV471oA&oe=6AF47472"}, {"file_name": "23.png", "id": "824209163781058", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827626_824209167114391_7872222521021636363_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dNhZ97TmVDQQ7kNvwGP6ZQl&_nc_oc=AdrMlt58g3X8-7aF071NuTpK9QXJ7yro-2uxdl5nBfgAJniPtu6TRltwHbKhAlY7Pyk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQIL0Zsh15g_17yXS8MSxzGTyGKaSheYqhDexl3qYitEA&oe=6AF48D4F"}, {"file_name": "21.png", "id": "967896346033576", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_967896349366909_2954946301595757138_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bRIBOLk_fboQ7kNvwGq3Abt&_nc_oc=AdoSijdFVTXn5Y6Y7mXG_hPqFXYsfaNe0nflw0NJqSwE9GxWND8dUrcyKRq4ES3wEYg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRON3crZdLQ558Wdq0sTsqFvNVkuR_2_oZ1kaIaVjVN4Q&oe=6AF491F7"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1531300608639730", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_1531300611973063_9058646323360018751_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zbjC7rfc3-kQ7kNvwH-WsCt&_nc_oc=Adpzqh9f0SWg85UsiZ0mY8vtRkarhSzQJQxaGk3HTf0lfeZUGQDdxClZjRBFNgYexo8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTSz1imqAj3J0ZGUotPD7W_msN3FkcwK6VfIVc5p_0VgA&oe=6AF46D2A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Zombies", "keywords": ["zombie", "shooter", "undead", "ragdoll", "shoot"], "long_description": "Step into a zombie sandbox shooter where physics-driven gameplay, a full-body controller system, and stylized action come together. Experiment freely with a wide variety of weapons as zombies react dynamically, lose limbs, crawl, and collapse in chaotic, physics-based encounters.\n{1274756444826142}\nPlayers can physically grab, aim, reload, and swap weapons with intuitive motion controls, creating a realistic firefight experience that feels natural and engaging. Enjoy precise two-handed rifle support with smooth recoil feedback and interactive magazine mechanics.\n{1639174897351635}\nEnemies are fully ragdolled and react dynamically to damage. Shoot off limbs and watch zombies adapt. Losing legs forces them to crawl. Instead of realistic horror, the game embraces a stylized, exaggerated visual style with non-realistic blood effects designed to keep the experience fun and accessible rather than disturbing.\n\nBuilt as a sandbox, the game encourages experimentation. Test different weapons, and explore how enemies respond to physics-driven destruction. Every encounter becomes a small simulation where movement, impact, and environment all matter.\n\nThis gamefocuses on replayability, physical interaction, and satisfying VR feedback loops.\n\n", "short_description": "A zombie shooter sandbox featuring ragdoll physics, a full-body VR controller, modular weapon support, and stylized combat effects. Experiment with a wide range of weapons while enemies react dynamically, lose limbs, crawl, and collapse in a fun way."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://molancegames.com/privacy-policy-3", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "pub